| Misinterpretation of Traffic Signs | 0.6 |

---
### **Conclusion**
The scene presents **high-risk conditions** primarily due to **reduced visibility** and **wet road conditions**. The autonomous system must rely on **sensor fusion (LiDAR, radar, camera)** and **predictive algorithms** to mitigate these risks. Additional **defensive driving strategies** (e.g., increased following distance, cautious acceleration) should be employed in such environments.